And these people who go see pain up close and intense, do they come back
with greater understanding of the causes, and more able to do something
about it?  Or just more motivated to do something, anything, no matter
whether it helps or exacerbates the problem, so long as they're not sitting
on their duff like me?

As someone else said, for those who need it, fine, but I don't think I need
it.  I don't need to visit the dying to know that pain is undesirable and
